Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Dezvoltare de software și Dezvoltare de software personalizat pentru sisteme IT
⚙️ We are looking for an experienced Senior Java Developer to join our agile team and play a key role in the design, development, and delivery of innovative, scalable, and high-quality solutions. In this role, you will contribute across the entire software development lifecycle, collaborate closely with business stakeholders and Front Office teams, and help drive technical excellence through modern engineering practices and continuous improvement initiatives. 💻
 🎯 Responsibilities: 
Design and develop new features front to back as part of an agile/scrum team;
Ensure the delivery of high-quality and scalable solutions using modern development practices such as clean code, automated testing, monitoring, alerting and secure by design;
Provide L3 support on application in production environment, when needed;
Drive innovation and contribute with new ideas for the existing architecture, services and processes;
Maintain and improve the continuous integration and delivery environment;
Maintain a close relationship with the Front Office team and ensure the delivery of high quality features.
 👤 Profile: 
Solid knowledge of Java 11 at least, Spring, relational database (PostgreSQL, Sybase), GIT, Maven;
Good knowledge of Java Microservices, Spring Boot, JPA, REST;
Java 21, Docker, Kubernetes, ELK, JavaScript with Angular or React would be a plus;
Good knowledge of Linux environment and Shell scripting required;
Hands-on experience with tools such as Eclipse/IntelliJ, Jenkins or Github Actions CI/CD Pipelines, JUnit, Jira, Cucumber;
You have a Bachelor degree in Computer Science or equivalent;
Good command of English, both written and spoken with the ability to participate in English-only meetings.
 If you are looking for an opportunity to take ownership of complex technical challenges, work with modern technologies, and make a significant impact within a collaborative and innovative environment, we would be delighted to welcome you to our team. 💡
